Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:07.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被神威大典不可思議的力量所指引
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:07.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(685,960)}Majesty Chronicon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來到了過去的藍天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1230,960)}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.97,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不 從今天起我就是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.11,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:17.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}高尚愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.57,0:00:27.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在戰鬥結束前 要藏好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去Cure Noble那裡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:31.62,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:42.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝·暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:45.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是女帝的爸爸...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:49.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·破曉終結
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Magic Hours End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:02.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}無用的小知識：這裡的hours有歧義，也能理解成ours和awards。\N去掉八竿子打不著的ours，譯作"魔法斷罪"也挺霸氣的。\N不過考慮magic hour是指日出前和日落後，一天裡天空顏色變化最多最快的時間段\N有的朋友大概已經冒出"逢魔"二字了，不過大家看後面的劇情就能明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:14.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,又來礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:17.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,襲擊沒有罪過的嘟嘟鳥族的村莊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量才是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:22.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所以弱小便是罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:26.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,如若我說 你的理解有悖常識
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:30.42,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,力量並非一切 陛下又當如何應對？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 Cure Noble
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:46.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要去公主的城市？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.43,0:01:50.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家正在齊心協力 重建城市
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:54.56,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,熱烈歡迎哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}暗塌谷帝國的善良少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你教會了我很多很多...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 學到的知識越多 我就越是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量真的是一切嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:54.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,對從誕生自這暗塌谷能量海中... 誕生自最強力量的我們而言
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這是無可爭辯的真理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:01.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量便是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡也被破壞得一塌糊塗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 有點難以置信...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:18.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘟嘟鳥們！你們來了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前幾日承蒙關照！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好香啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少錢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免費的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的家被破壞了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧 這姑娘烤的麵包 好吃到打耳光都不肯放的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻... 要哪一種？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難辦啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:45.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個麻煩你處理了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:49.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:55.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:05:00.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿噠噠噠噠噠噠...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:12.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:14.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇 快住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭只會催生出眼淚！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:34.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量既一切 力量才是一切啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:42.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,保不准哪一天 藍天大地會開一個通道 攻打進這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:44.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量就是為了防患於未然！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你是余寶貴的女兒...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.15,0:05:52.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國的皇女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.59,0:05:54.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要變得更強！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那邊那誰！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說你呢 就是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我們下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在上面搞麻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我有事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 哦 哦 哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小妹妹 戴的首飾不錯哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有那精緻的衣裳...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是有錢人是吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大哥 大哥 大哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這丫頭在嘆氣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你對我們有意見嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看清楚了！現在的時代力量才是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別... 別誤會...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是在助人為樂...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:57.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,想要進城避難的人 我們來者不拒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:00.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 也會有像他們那樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:01.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,你受驚了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量是一切... 才是正確的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我不這麼認為
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:18.98,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,因為戰爭只會催生出眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天淚公主 我有重要的事要跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:34.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 你遇到了女帝...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:40.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 她跟我說"希望結束這場戰爭"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:42.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那個女帝會這麼說...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,和我們所認識的 簡直判若兩人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.54,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,她是這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.84,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,“我絕對會說服父親的”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:57.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,"可是 他認為要是輸的話 自己就會國破人亡"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,“所以 希望我們能夠寬恕皇帝”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:05.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,“也希望你停止戰爭”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:11.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠... 相信她嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:14.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我願意相信她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:18.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,無信任 無改變
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:26.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也願意相信 相信女帝的天淚公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:28.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你前來赴約 天淚公主
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:04.03,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能說服令尊 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:08.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠迎來與貴國和解這一刻...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.77,0:09:11.47,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,甚是令我歡喜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:14.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要確認一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:18.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你有沒有想過 這次是余引誘你出面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:25.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,而余的部下 此刻正在奇襲都城的調虎離山之計？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:30.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:36.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你還想要終結戰爭... 還敢口出狂言 說要寬恕余嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:52.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:56.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,回答余 能否寬恕余！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:14.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:17.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！這就是力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴 亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 Cure Noble！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:29.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正正正... 正是因為身處力量才是一切的這個時代
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,善良才是最寶貴的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說的和做的完全相反啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:54.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你這只會欺負弱小的膽小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:00.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有種就過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:03.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊 來啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:13.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼啊 你過來！跟著拍手聲來！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:29.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:31.24,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大成功！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轟鳴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:39.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看來對話不是太順利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:42.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在天淚公主回來前...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我們亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.64,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇！Cure Noble！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:06.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:25.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,余現在就證明給你看 力量才是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,光美
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,破曉終結
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.04,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Magic Hours End
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:09.86,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:14.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:16.09,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了... 像我這種弱者 也保護了父皇...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下 父皇是不是明白了 力量並非一切...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:37.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女兒啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:41.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我都做了什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請原諒... 我父皇...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:56.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,皇帝 能用你的力量縫合傷口嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:59.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量沒有這種功能...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:05.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不！能夠辦到的 現在的你是能辦到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:12.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:21.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？難不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了... 突然就...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:28.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這力量居然還有這種用法...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:49.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 我犯下了罪過
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:56.01,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,被憤怒沖昏了頭腦 忘記了戰爭只會催生出眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 是一位少女...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:05.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是這位女帝·暗塌谷 讓我們重新睜開了眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:11.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,是她的善良 終結了這場戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:28.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,在這夜日交替之際 在這美麗的瞬間！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:32.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地與暗塌谷帝國 締結和平條約！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（歡呼聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.19,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:01.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,數以千計的亂暴獸會出現在城裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:04.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,城市在一瞬間就會被摧毀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:05.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.43,0:16:14.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在這夜日交替之際 在這美麗的瞬間！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這句話...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:24.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是你終結了藍天大地與暗塌谷帝國的戰爭...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:29.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！是什麼改變了你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:31.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在說什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:32.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們見證了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:39.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典引導我們 見證了300年前的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:43.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們見到了傳說中的Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,攻城先放一邊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:55.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你們現在就閉嘴 消失在我的面前！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
