Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:29.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不對！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:33.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠與你談話解決問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:35.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:39.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就不閉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.49,0:20:40.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:44.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不交流不交心！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:46.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,被憤怒沖昏了頭互相鬥爭！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:52.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這種... 這種戰爭只會催生出眼淚啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:57.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,說得你很懂似的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:01.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:13.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,300年前的傷口裂開了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:16.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我無所謂！你一個人逃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:22.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,保護你 是我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:41.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了這種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:46.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝為什麼會改變呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.10,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒有結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.23,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再嘗試跟她交流
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:56.38,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的話 就再下次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.99,0:22:00.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:09.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}蝴蝶愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.97,0:22:12.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起飛揚跳起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:49.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的人們都無精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:51.42,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫他們換換心情嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:52.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,開派對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.95,0:23:55.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 今天可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,誕聖節！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,誕聖節！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:58.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,誕聖節？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:58.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,誕聖節？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:01.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:01.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄們的聖誕節
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:57.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:02:03.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:08.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:16.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:21.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:31.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:36.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:42.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.07,0:02:46.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:50.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:50.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:52.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:57.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:02.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:07.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:12.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:23.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
